<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27472" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">māchĭnārĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		machina, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to machines,
				machine-</i> (postclass.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mola,</span>”
				<i>which is worked by an animal by means of a
					machine</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 7, p. 194, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">asinus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					33, 7, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mensor,</span>”
				<i>a surveyor</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">ib.
					11, 6, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">commentator,</span>”
				<i>a machinist, machine-builder</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">māchĭnārĭus</span></b> ,
				ii, m., <i>one who works
				on a scaffold</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 9, 2, 31</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
